rule ShiftHandoverAgedWorkOrders
	lineageTag: 4c5b0e9f-76d5-53c1-b851-20257feec030
	statement: At shift handover, flag every work order still open after 30 minutes for the incoming shift, and note any line that triggered the below-60% OEE escalation.

	ruleReferencedEntity maintenance#WorkOrder
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty created_at

	ruleReferencedEntity production#Shift
